stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING
    PENDING --> RUNNING: start(started_at)
    RUNNING --> RUNNING: record_stage_start / record_stage_success
    RUNNING --> COMPLETED: complete(completed_at)
    RUNNING --> FAILED: fail / record_stage_failure
    RUNNING --> SHUTDOWN: shutdown(shutdown_at)
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    SHUTDOWN --> [*]

    note right of RUNNING
      Stage results do not introduce another run state.
      Completion requires at least one recorded stage,
      with every stage SUCCESS and valid explicit timestamps.
      Terminal states reject further stage mutation.
    end note
